msgstr "¡Toma eso, naturaleza!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.BUSH_VINE.GENERIC"
