#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.EVERGREEN_SPARSE.BURNT"
