msgstr "¡Los bivalvos son mi debilidad!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS"
