msgstr "Très sospechoso..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LIVING_ARTIFACT"
