msgstr "¡Te estoy esperando!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTER_DEAD"
