msgstr "Me pregunto si podría conseguir oro comestible."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MAGNIFYING_GLASS"
