msgstr "Esas hortalizas ensordecedoras viven ahí."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.MANDRAKEMAN"
