#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.PORKLAND_ENTRANCE"
