msgstr "¡Un enemigo acecha!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHARKFINSOUP"
