msgstr "¡Algo acecha a la espera!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHARKITTENSPAWNER.INACTIVE"
