msgstr "Descansa bien en el Valhalla."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SKELETON_PLAYER"
