#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBAT.GENERIC"
