msgstr "Mala suerte, pequeña bestia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.VAMPIREBATCAVE"
