msgstr "Me temo que tengo una fuga."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_BOAT_SINKING_IMMINENT"
