#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN_COLLECTOR.SLEEPING"
