msgstr "¡Qué nenúfar tan grande!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONE"
