msgstr "¿Tenemos que comerlas?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.LIMPETS_COOKED"
