msgstr "Inevitable."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LAWNORNAMENT.BURNT"
