msgstr "Qué paz irradia sobre el agua."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIMESTONE"
