msgstr "Parecen comestibles... más o menos."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LIMPETROCK.PICKED"
