msgstr "Su muerte me dará la vida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WENDY.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERHOLE"
