msgstr "¡Vaya, qué producción!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.FISH_FARM.STOCKED"
