msgstr "¿No hay agua caliente?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBOT"
