msgstr "¡Hace el café de Patapalo!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN"
