msgstr "Me sirve para enfriarme."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COLDFIRE.OUT"
