#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wagstaff
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wagstaff"
msgid ""
"*A great inventor\n"
"*Nearsighted\n"
"*Delicate Stomach"
msgstr ""
"° Es un gran inventor.\n"
"° Miope.\n"
"° Tiene un estómago delicado."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.walani
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.walani"
msgid ""
"*Loves surfing\n"
"*Dries off quickly\n"
"*Is a pretty chill gal"
msgstr ""
"° Le encanta surfear.\n"
"° Se seca fácilmente.\n"
"° Es una chica muy relajada."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.warbucks
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.warbucks"
msgid ""
"*Is an explorer\n"
"*Loves his fortune\n"
"*Picky eater"
msgstr ""
"° Es un explorador.\n"
"° Ama su fortuna.\n"
"° Delicado con la comida."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.warly
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.warly"
msgid ""
"*Has a refined palate\n"
"*Cooks in custom kitchenware\n"
"*Brings a stylish chef pouch"
msgstr ""
"° Tiene un paladar refinado.\n"
"° Cocina con utensilios personalizados.\n"
"° Lleva una elegante bolsa de chef."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr"
msgid ""
"*Excels in battle \n"
"*Absorbs the power of fallen foes \n"
"*Only eats meat"
msgstr ""
"° Sobresale en la batalla.\n"
"° Gana poder de los enemigos caídos.\n"
"° Únicamente come carne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell"
msgid ""
"*Is dapper, but frail \n"
"*Can split his mind into pieces \n"
"*On a first-name basis with the night"
msgstr ""
"° Es elegante pero delicado. \n"
"° Puede fragmentar su mente. \n"
"° Familiarizado con las sombras."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.webber"
msgid ""
"*Is a monster\n"
"*Can befriend spiders\n"
"*Grows a silky smooth beard"
msgstr ""
"° Es un monstruo.\n"
"° Puede hacerse amigo de las arañas.\n"
"° Le crece una barba suave y sedosa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy"
msgid ""
"*Is haunted by her twin sister \n"
"*Feels comfortable in the dark \n"
"*Doesn't hit very hard"
msgstr ""
"° Atormentada por su hermana gemela.\n"
"° Se siente cómoda en la oscuridad.\n"
"° No golpea muy fuerte."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTER_DESCRIPTIONS.wes"
